        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>MNG 836, Poise 3 Inch Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFrom the MNG Poise Collection, the Poise Cabinet Pull 3 Inch Center to Center has all the features of high-end cabinet hardware--including the elegant style--without the price tag. The Poise 3 Inch Pull was designed to add sophistication to any lightweight door or drawer with is stunning style and classic finish color options. The Poise 3 Inch Cabinet Pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet pull is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=MNG+Poise\">MNG Poise Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the MNG 836 Poise 3 Inch Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Material: Zinc </li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i> \r\n</p>",
